translations.text:
All the past wants to take hold of me
and I want to take hold of the future;
it twists my head around so I will look back,
and I want to look ahead.

Solitude and silence do not frighten me;
they are God's favorite places
to reveal himself.

My eternal gratitude to those who love me;
I will always remember them in the sunlight.

I cannot stop.
Forgive me, I am in a hurry;
I am a river of strength, and if I stop
I will drown in my own still water.
